Dimension	Question

Causation	What contributed to the outcome?
Influence	What changed system behavior?
Control	Who could direct the relevant process?
Duty	Who was constitutionally obligated to act?
Responsibility	Who bears a constitutionally supported responsibility?


This prevents semantic collapse.


