EVIDENCE_CONVERGENCE

EVIDENCE_CONFLICT

INFERENCE_DISTANCE

UNCERTAINTY_BURDEN

DECISION_CONSEQUENCE

THRESHOLD_MARGIN

THRESHOLD_FRAGILITY

Core question:

> How much evidentiary distance exists between what we know and what we are about to decide?




---

VI. 🔮 ORACLE — SUFFICIENCY OBSERVATORY

ORACLE receives:

EVIDENCE_THRESHOLD_OBSERVATORY

Signals:

