AUTHENTIC SOURCE
      ↓
AUTHENTIC OBSERVATION

from:

AUTHENTIC OBSERVATION
      ↓
CORRECT INTERPRETATION?

The latter remains a separate question.

Therefore:

> Authenticity does not establish sufficiency.




