XV. 🏠 9EZIN — HOUSEHOLD DECISION THRESHOLDS

9EZIN applies proportionality:

MINOR HOUSEHOLD ADAPTATION
       ↓
LOW CONSEQUENCE
       ↓
LIGHT REVIEW

versus:

MATERIAL AUTHORITY CHANGE
       ↓
HIGH CONSEQUENCE
       ↓
HIGHER THRESHOLD

Thus constitutional rigor scales with consequence without becoming unnecessarily bureaucratic.


---

XVI. 🪶 FEATHER — EVIDENCE UNDER EVOLUTION

FEATHER introduces:

EVOLUTIONARY_EVIDENCE_THRESHOLD

Evolutionary success provides evidence that a pattern is viable.

It does not establish:

VIABILITY
=
CONSTITUTIONAL VALIDITY

Therefore:

> Persistence may increase evidentiary relevance without independently satisfying constitutional sufficiency.




