REVERSIBILITY_EXPLANATION

For material decisions:

WHY MADE?
WHY VALID?
HOW IMPLEMENTED?
WHAT CHANGED?
WHAT DEPENDENCIES FORMED?
WHAT WOULD REVERSAL REQUIRE?

Mentor must distinguish:

> “The decision remains valid.”



from:

> “The decision has become difficult to reverse.”



These are entirely different propositions.


