UNCERTAIN CLAIM
 ↓
LOCAL CONTEXT
 ↓
BOUNDED USE

must not silently become:

UNCERTAIN CLAIM
 ↓
SYSTEM MEMORY
 ↓
GLOBAL ASSUMPTION
 ↓
AUTHORITY

